data-id=\"9127664350\"></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Head back to the main timeline and you will see your notes below the date reading.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">To pin the note to the top of screen press the <em dir=\"ltr\">pin picture</em> </p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9127665031/original/pKnYLAGgSHOfBjxFzrqmKNFIgNSwBpmJTw.png?1619011038\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9127665031\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once clicked, the note will be displayed under <strong>F</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\">ocused</strong> notes</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9127665331/original/0pslSXr5BVrtIRJMv0MMHMgJazD1D7sPag.png?1619011171\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9127665331\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can pin multiple notes under Focused notes.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">You can unpin a note by unclicking the pin icon again.</p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000201273\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000201273/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000201273\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><spa